"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A search and rescue operation is happening to find survivors on Flores, an island in eastern Indonesia. Security was increased because of social media suggestions about another big crossing on Saturday.\",            \"english_title\": \"Search in Flores\",            \"translated_version\": \"Hay una operaci\u00f3n de b\u00fasqueda y rescate para encontrar sobrevivientes en Flores, una isla en el este de Indonesia. La seguridad aument\u00f3 por sugerencias en redes sociales sobre otro gran cruce el s\u00e1bado.\",            \"translated_title\": \"B\u00fasqueda en Flores\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A father and his two young sons were rescued after spending a night drifting off the coast of the island of Koh Samui.\",            \"english_title\": \"Family Rescued at Sea\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un padre y sus dos hijos peque\u00f1os fueron rescatados despu\u00e9s de pasar una noche a la deriva cerca de la isla de Koh Samui.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Familia Rescatada en el Mar\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Police responded to reports of a shooting outside residence halls at about 01:28 local time on Saturday.\",            \"english_title\": \"Shooting Near Dorms\",            \"translated_version\": \"La polic\u00eda respondi\u00f3 a informes de un tiroteo fuera de los dormitorios a las 01:28 hora local el s\u00e1bado.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tiroteo Cerca de Dormitorios\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Israel's military said it attacked Hezbollah's terror infrastructure because of earlier actions against its soldiers.\",            \"english_title\": \"Israel Attacks Hezbollah\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ej\u00e9rcito de Israel dijo que atac\u00f3 la infraestructura de terror de Hezbollah por acciones anteriores contra sus soldados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Israel Ataca a Hezbollah\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Thousands of sailors on the Lincoln ship have faced food shortages and broken plumbing, with some thinking about jumping overboard.\",            \"english_title\": \"Problems on Lincoln Ship\",            \"translated_version\": \"Miles de marineros en el barco Lincoln han enfrentado escasez de comida y tuber\u00edas rotas, con algunos pensando en saltar al agua.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problemas en el Barco Lincoln\"        }    ]}"